id: 29
hanzi: 姑娘
pinyin: gū niang
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: girl; young woman; daughter; maiden
  es: muchacha; chica; joven; hija; doncella

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | a girl; young unmarried woman | muchacha; chica joven; doncella | 年轻的姑娘 (a young woman)
  2 | Noun | Colloquial | daughter (in family contexts, e.g. 大姑娘) | hija | 他家的大姑娘 (the eldest daughter in his family)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 除夕之夜，村里的小姑娘穿上了鲜艳的红棉袄，帮着母亲在大门上贴红纸春联。 | Chúxī zhī yè, cūnlǐ de xiǎo gūniang chuānshàng le xiānyàn de hóngmián'ǎo, bāng zhe mǔqīn zài dàmén shàng tiē hóngzhǐ chūnlián. | On New Year's Eve, the little girl in the village put on a bright red padded jacket, helping her mother paste red paper Spring Festival couplets on the front gate. | En nochevieja, la jovencita de la aldea se vistió con una chaqueta roja acolchada y ayudó a su madre a pegar las coplas de papel rojo en el portón.
  #2 | 毕业典礼上，那位坚强扎根基层乡村任教的年轻姑娘，荣获了本年度全省杰出青年教师称号。 | Bìyè diǎnlǐ shàng, nà wèi jiānqiáng zhāgēn jīcéng xiāngcūn rènjiào de niánqīng gūniang, rónghuò le běn niándù quán shěng jiéchū qīngnián jiàoshī chēnghào. | At the graduation ceremony, that courageous young woman dedicated to teaching in rural grassroots schools was awarded the title of the province's outstanding young educator of the year. | En la graduación, aquella valiente joven consagrada a la enseñanza en escuelas rurales fue distinguida como docente joven ejemplar de la provincia.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  年轻姑娘 | young girl / young woman
